                    <rule name="Maw-grunta" id="8297-707d-b6d2-e8fa" hidden="true">
                      <description>Add the **Maw-grunta&apos;s Tusks** weapon to your hero&apos;s warscroll. 
In addition, make the following changes to your hero&apos;s warscroll:
• Change the Move characteristic to 10&quot;.
• Change the Health characteristic to 14.
• Change the Control characteristic to 5.
